      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUNDRED YARDS (1) disappointed last start when up in trip at Roebourne, though his prior form stacks up nicely for a race like this. Faithfull sticks with the gelding here and the drop back in trip holds the key. Should sit handy from the outset and can return to winning ways. KARSAVINA (2) was far too good here last time out and returns to the scene of the crime. Things look to work out nicely for her from a nice gate and with further improvement on the cards, she creates plenty of interest. SOLAR SYSTEM (3) has been in the placings at his last two starts, finishing third last time over 1300m at this track after he was well back on straightening. Best figures measure up. Sure to run well. ACES TO WIN (6) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1615m at this track, finishing seventh. Well placed and can figure in the finish this time. MOMENT IN THE SUN (4) won't be far away.",
